message: "If you use these benchmarks, please cite them as below."
title: "Computer algebra system benchmarks: reproducible, verified and dated benchmarks of computer algebra systems"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Celles
    given-names: Sébastien
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9987-4338"
    affiliation: "IUT de Poitiers, Université de Poitiers"
repository-code: "https://github.com/s-celles/computer-algebra-system-benchmarks"
